Publish spec to personal registry

Usage: akm skills publish [OPTIONS] [ID]

Arguments:
  [ID]  Spec ID to publish. Omit to publish everything pending

Options:
      --dry-run  Preview changes without applying
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
